# Phase 14f: material for assets/models/sphere.obj -- the editor Create
# menu's "Sphere" primitive. A cool teal-green, distinct from the existing
# demo materials this project already has checked in (falling_cube.mtl's
# yellow; scene.mtl's brown/blue/red -- see those files) so a freshly
# created sphere reads as its own distinct object in a headless screenshot,
# not a shade that could be mistaken for an existing entity.

newmtl Sphere
Kd 0.15 0.60 0.50
Ka 0.15 0.60 0.50
Ks 0.35 0.35 0.35
Ns 48.0
